  id: 59
  missionName: THE DROWNED GUARDIAN
  missionType: BOSS
  briefing: Under the nave is the way down, and across it stands the thing his father
    set there ten years ago, to keep the last of the Seal from anyone. Including
    his own children.
  debrief: 'It falls. Under it: not a key. A message.'
  marsh: 1
  nightOverride: 1
  rain: 0
  snow: 0
  fog: 0
  applyTheme: 1
  theme: 4
  missionRadius: 0
  missionRadiusZ: 0
  nextReason: His father left words instead of a key. The words say why.
